<title>ECUADOR: Ecuador cocoa and cocoa products export prices.</title>
<headline>Ecuador cocoa and cocoa products export prices.</headline>
<dateline>QUITO 1997-07-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following is a list of the minimum FOB reference prices for export of 100-pound (45.36 kilo) sacks of Ecuadorean cocoa and cocoa products, effective from July 17 to July 23 the 1997:</p>
<p>    Arriba Superior Epoca......................$ 67.02</p>
<p>    Arriba Superior Summer.....................$ 71.38</p>
<p>    Arriba Superior Summer Select..............$ 73.39</p>
<p>    Arriba Superior Summer Plantation Select...$ 77.07</p>
<p>    Cocoa butter...............................$180.87</p>
<p>    Residual butter............................$135.65</p>
<p>Unsweeten or bitter cocoa,</p>
<p>    Cocoa liquor or paste......................$100.55</p>
<p>    Cocoa cake.................................$ 26.02</p>
<p>    Residual natural cake......................$  2.60</p>
<p>    Cocoa powder...............................$ 28.70</p>
</text>
